  "rang = □ ; colonnes : {n} ; lignes : {m}.": "rank = □; columns: {n}; rows: {m}.",
  "{T}, T(x) = Ax, et {MLm} est une forme échelonnée de A. Compte les pivots par ligne et par colonne : T est-elle injective ? surjective ?": "{T}, T(x) = Ax, and {MLm} is an echelon form of A. Count the pivots by row and by column: is T injective? surjective?",
  "Échelonne A.": "Row reduce A to echelon form.",
  "Soit {T}, T(x) = Ax avec A = {A}. T est-elle injective ? surjective ? Commence par regarder les tailles, puis choisis chaque opération.": "Let {T}, T(x) = Ax with A = {A}. Is T injective? surjective? Start by looking at the sizes, then choose each operation.",
  "Soit {T}, T(x) = Ax avec A = {A}. T est-elle injective ? surjective ?": "Let {T}, T(x) = Ax with A = {A}. Is T injective? surjective?",
